import EmbeddingDimensionStrata.TopologySphereCharts

/-!
# Classical-topology obstructions

Public entry point for Lemma nonaffine (3) and the topological part of Theorem q48
of the manuscript on embedding-dimension strata.

The ordinary classical punctured product is proved simply connected, and is
proved not homeomorphic to the proposed C* × C^56. The development proves the
required two-open van Kampen theorem, applies stereographic charts to spheres,
and uses exponential-cover monodromy for the nontrivial fundamental group of C*.
No main geometric or topological conclusion is an assumption.
-/
